        {
          "title": "Everyone in Seattle hates AI",
          "url": "https://jonready.com/blog/posts/everyone-in-seattle-hates-ai.html",
          "source": "Hacker News",
          "date": "2025-12-03T19:37:25Z",
          "language": "en",
          "section": "us_news",
          "raw_content": "I grabbed lunch with a former Microsoft coworker I've always admired—one of those engineers who can take any idea, even a mediocre one, and immediately find the gold in it. I wanted her take on Wanderfugl 🐦, the AI-powered map I've been building full-time. I expected encouragement. At worst, overly generous feedback because she knows what I've sacrificed. Instead, she reacted to it with a level of negativity I'd never seen her direct at me before.",
          "organization": "",
